WEBVTT

00:00:04.540 --> 00:00:08.940
For humanity to become the 
true masters of this world,

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:11.660
they must be free of all control.

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:14.620
Alchemy pursues perfection.

00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:18.610
We cannot let its march be 
halted by the Symphogears.

00:00:29.290 --> 00:00:32.570
We'll watch Maria and Elfnein.

00:00:32.570 --> 00:00:34.040
You should go to the command room.

00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:35.220
The commander is calling.

00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:38.200
Thanks. Take care of them.

00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:43.020
Dr. Ver...

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:45.770
You were supposed to be dead...

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:48.380
I don't know what's going on...

00:00:48.380 --> 00:00:51.030
But something seems wrong.

00:02:32.380 --> 00:02:36.380
<b>Episode 6
Surfacing From the Suicide Zone</b>

00:02:33.850 --> 00:02:37.140
I'm pretty sure, I'm definitely sure, 
that I know what this is!

00:02:37.140 --> 00:02:42.010
I get to shout at the heart of 
Maria's heart! This is the best!

00:02:42.010 --> 00:02:45.300
I don't remember him acting like this...

00:02:45.300 --> 00:02:49.740
Which means he was created from 
your impressions of Dr. Ver,

00:02:49.740 --> 00:02:54.100
as well as other memories, perhaps?

00:02:54.550 --> 00:02:56.770
I feel like giving my memories a talking-to.

00:02:56.770 --> 00:03:00.350
Perhaps your subconscious 
is pointing to the part

00:03:00.350 --> 00:03:04.050
of the brain that the Symphogear connects to.

00:03:04.670 --> 00:03:06.810
Airgetlám is guiding me?

00:03:07.280 --> 00:03:10.640
Then there were better people 
to do it, like Serena.

00:03:10.640 --> 00:03:15.080
What it's showing is something directly 
linked to your memories of Dr. Ver.

00:03:15.080 --> 00:03:16.660
Which means...

00:03:17.930 --> 00:03:20.520
Biologist! Hero!

00:03:20.520 --> 00:03:24.890
And speed-eater, too! I'm 
everything you'd ever want!

00:03:24.890 --> 00:03:29.230
That's right! I've always 
told you the plain truth!

00:03:29.230 --> 00:03:30.990
I've never hidden it!

00:03:30.990 --> 00:03:31.570
Then...

00:03:31.800 --> 00:03:36.390
If you've forgotten, then you need 
to reach out and pick it up yourself.

00:03:36.390 --> 00:03:38.910
From the bottom of the bottom 
of the bottom of your memories!

00:03:38.910 --> 00:03:41.040
You'll find it there!

00:03:41.870 --> 00:03:43.180
Maria-san!

00:03:44.070 --> 00:03:45.990
Stay close to me, Elfnein!

00:03:49.820 --> 00:03:57.750
<i>Balwisyall nescell Gungnir tron.</i>

00:04:24.750 --> 00:04:27.500
<i>My fist is the first to strike</i>

00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:30.060
<i>My fist charges straight forward</i>

00:04:28.070 --> 00:04:30.680
What worries me is what the 
alchemists are going to do.

00:04:30.060 --> 00:04:31.530
<i>Keep on pushing forward</i>

00:04:30.680 --> 00:04:33.590
Let's keep our swords sheathed 
and fight without Ignite.

00:04:31.530 --> 00:04:32.830
<i>Keep on singing</i>

00:04:32.830 --> 00:04:35.460
<i>Passionate Spear Justice</i>

00:04:33.590 --> 00:04:38.790
I don't know what they're after, 
but their plots won't work on me!

00:04:35.460 --> 00:04:40.460
<i>The justice I choose, 
the justice I found for myself</i>

00:04:40.460 --> 00:04:45.550
<i>I swear I'll never let it go</i>

00:04:46.130 --> 00:04:51.500
<i>Keep charging forward even 
if your voice grows hoarse</i>

00:04:47.390 --> 00:04:52.180
What makes me a protector isn't 
blood, but a passionate heart!

00:04:51.500 --> 00:05:00.880
<i>Charge forward, I'll never 
let the song in my heart die</i>

00:04:58.230 --> 00:04:59.650
<b>Reverse Rakshasa</b>

00:05:01.650 --> 00:05:04.900
<i>A strike of certain love, 
protecting no matter what</i>

00:05:02.040 --> 00:05:04.900
Alca-Noise are down to 68% 
of their original numbers.

00:05:04.900 --> 00:05:06.820
<i>Love will never lose</i>

00:05:04.900 --> 00:05:07.290
But there's no sign of the alchemists...

00:05:06.820 --> 00:05:09.980
<i>Gripping tight with all my power and strength</i>

00:05:09.980 --> 00:05:12.200
<i>Telling my heart to hang in there</i>

00:05:12.200 --> 00:05:17.560
<i>Devour the lightning and crush the thunder</i>

00:05:17.560 --> 00:05:20.260
<i>A burning heart, a flying heart</i>

00:05:19.120 --> 00:05:22.810
Is he the one who's bringing 
all these guys with him?

00:05:20.260 --> 00:05:23.870
<i>Fly through the sky you judged!</i>

00:05:23.140 --> 00:05:24.890
Which means he's our target!

00:05:24.890 --> 00:05:26.690
I'll tell you when to fire.

00:05:26.690 --> 00:05:28.370
Tsubasa-san, you pull the trigger!

00:05:30.500 --> 00:05:35.940
<i>The things we bear are 
the things we can't see</i>

00:05:31.800 --> 00:05:33.440
Let's show them true power!

00:05:35.940 --> 00:05:38.550
<i>Bonds of passion, bonds that burn</i>

00:05:38.550 --> 00:05:43.460
<i>I want to make them resonate together!</i>

00:05:43.050 --> 00:05:46.440
And I'm a girl who can clean up!

00:06:00.930 --> 00:06:03.040
No! Did we fail to take it down?

00:06:03.040 --> 00:06:06.760
The massive Alca-Noise split. 
Its parts have reactivated.

00:06:06.760 --> 00:06:07.760
There are three of them.

00:06:08.050 --> 00:06:10.600
They're all going in different directions.

00:06:11.480 --> 00:06:13.860
They're trying to split the Wielders up?

00:06:13.860 --> 00:06:16.440
Commander, incoming message 
from the Iruma base!

00:06:16.440 --> 00:06:18.770
They say they'll send 
reinforcements if necessary.

00:06:19.030 --> 00:06:20.130
No way!

00:06:20.130 --> 00:06:24.330
The Air Self-Defense Force's equipment 
can't even delay an Alca-Noise.

00:06:24.330 --> 00:06:25.770
They may just cause more casualties.

00:06:26.260 --> 00:06:30.350
No, tell Iruma to send a Code 814.

00:06:30.680 --> 00:06:32.630
Harriers? Here?

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:34.400
Roger.

00:06:36.370 --> 00:06:39.290
Even if they're trying to split us up,

00:06:39.290 --> 00:06:42.880
we're all able to deal with 
the smaller sizes on our own!

00:06:44.690 --> 00:06:47.550
We each need to take down one each, right?

00:06:49.060 --> 00:06:51.650
You may be right, but...

00:06:57.790 --> 00:07:01.080
I can't let anyone else get involved...

00:07:23.840 --> 00:07:25.450
They just keep coming!

00:07:37.560 --> 00:07:40.020
I knew it. It's splitting again?!

00:08:03.640 --> 00:08:06.120
How much work are you 
trying to make me do?

00:08:09.390 --> 00:08:11.430
Hang in there, you two...

00:08:12.840 --> 00:08:15.310
Everybody else is doing their best.

00:08:20.990 --> 00:08:22.140
What is this place?

00:08:23.240 --> 00:08:27.600
It doesn't look like something 
your mind created...

00:08:30.500 --> 00:08:32.930
I want to be strong.

00:08:33.450 --> 00:08:35.900
That voice... was me?

00:08:36.380 --> 00:08:38.620
I don't want to let them see me being weak.

00:08:39.980 --> 00:08:42.020
No matter who I have to lie to.

00:08:42.020 --> 00:08:44.310
Even if I have to lie to my own heart.

00:08:44.720 --> 00:08:48.580
But... I don't really want to lie!

00:08:48.580 --> 00:08:52.160
This is Maria-san's inner universe.

00:08:52.640 --> 00:08:54.750
The darkness of my heart...

00:08:55.530 --> 00:08:58.030
From when I was too scared
 to accept weakness,

00:08:58.030 --> 00:09:01.910
and refused to bond with anyone...

00:09:03.050 --> 00:09:04.310
Maria-san...

00:09:05.310 --> 00:09:10.150
You have to stretch out your hand
 before you can take someone else's.

00:09:10.470 --> 00:09:11.230
But...

00:09:11.620 --> 00:09:15.360
If that hand is knocked away...

00:09:18.780 --> 00:09:19.920
Maria-san!

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:22.580
Maria-san! Maria-san!

00:09:23.010 --> 00:09:26.020
Maria-san!

00:09:54.900 --> 00:09:55.950
Now!

00:09:55.780 --> 00:09:57.450
<b>Thousand Falling Tears</b>

00:10:14.620 --> 00:10:19.460
I knew they'd try for a war of 
attrition, but this is rough...

00:10:23.220 --> 00:10:27.530
All shots on target! Take it all!

00:10:39.180 --> 00:10:41.740
If we can just take down the source...

00:10:45.500 --> 00:10:48.540
The rest'll just be a duck hunt.

00:10:53.710 --> 00:10:56.630
You can split, you can multiply...

00:11:00.290 --> 00:11:03.240
but I'll keep on taking you down!

00:11:08.520 --> 00:11:09.930
I'll keep on...

00:11:20.260 --> 00:11:26.490
<i>Am I going to vanish, 
drowned in the darkness I created?</i>

00:11:28.890 --> 00:11:34.010
<i>There are no "miracles" that create 
compatibility with a Symphogear.</i>

00:11:36.170 --> 00:11:41.990
<i>If you would make that power your 
own, just continue to reach out.</i>

00:11:48.970 --> 00:11:50.330
Maria-san!

00:11:53.070 --> 00:11:55.860
This is... the white orphanage?

00:11:56.440 --> 00:12:00.220
The one that belonged to FIS... 
the place where we were taken?

00:12:16.830 --> 00:12:20.830
You're going to begin combat training today.

00:12:20.830 --> 00:12:24.110
Receptor Children who could 
not become a vessel for Finé

00:12:24.110 --> 00:12:27.470
shall contribute to the organization 
by shedding blood instead of tears.

00:12:30.930 --> 00:12:33.480
<i>Is that really it?</i>

00:12:33.480 --> 00:12:36.340
<i>Were your memories really...</i>

00:12:33.480 --> 00:12:37.480
<i>Were my memories really only fear of Mom?</i>

00:12:40.610 --> 00:12:42.040
<i>That's right.</i>

00:12:42.040 --> 00:12:45.400
<i>The pain and fear caused me 
to seal away my memories.</i>

00:12:45.770 --> 00:12:49.940
<i>Whenever she hit me, 
Mom always looked so sad...</i>

00:13:13.090 --> 00:13:14.830
I shall begin the procedure.

00:13:25.420 --> 00:13:27.310
I can't do it, Mom.

00:13:27.310 --> 00:13:31.780
I can't be like Serena...

00:13:32.030 --> 00:13:35.750
Maria, you will not be 
allowed to give up.

00:13:36.160 --> 00:13:39.390
You decided to carry the burden 
of evil, and stay true to evil.

00:13:39.390 --> 00:13:42.710
Even if it's painful, you must endure.

00:13:49.360 --> 00:13:50.380
<i>That's right.</i>

00:13:51.010 --> 00:13:55.110
<i>No matter how many painful experiments 
or training exercises she made us do,</i>

00:13:55.110 --> 00:13:58.010
<i>Mom didn't let anyone fail.</i>

00:13:58.980 --> 00:14:00.670
<i>That's not all.</i>

00:14:00.670 --> 00:14:05.660
<i>When we rose up, the existence of 
the Receptor Children became known.</i>

00:14:05.660 --> 00:14:07.700
<i>All of us were taken someplace safe.</i>

00:14:08.520 --> 00:14:13.670
<i>She always suffered in silence 
so that we could survive.</i>

00:14:14.170 --> 00:14:18.960
The trick to making tomatoes delicious 
is to put them in a harsh environment.

00:14:19.240 --> 00:14:25.030
If you wait until the last second to give 
them water, they gain a natural sweetness.

00:14:26.230 --> 00:14:30.520
A great harvest only exists 
after enduring harshness.

00:14:31.590 --> 00:14:35.310
I wouldn't have survived on kindness alone.

00:14:35.870 --> 00:14:40.510
Mom's harshness, which gave us 
the strength we need to live.

00:14:40.510 --> 00:14:42.300
Behind it lay...

00:14:44.880 --> 00:14:50.150
<i>I always told you, and 
Nastasha, the same thing.</i>

00:14:50.490 --> 00:14:53.940
<i>What connects a human
 and a Symphogear is...</i>

00:14:53.940 --> 00:14:57.060
The visualized electrical signals are showing

00:14:57.060 --> 00:14:59.390
the part of the brain that 
connects with the gears...

00:14:59.390 --> 00:15:03.840
This is the part that controls deep, 
passionate feelings of love for others.

00:15:03.840 --> 00:15:06.680
If I can make the LiNKER work on it...

00:15:14.140 --> 00:15:15.340
Elfnein?

00:15:15.340 --> 00:15:16.640
What happened?

00:15:16.640 --> 00:15:19.090
Just a bit more work, and then...

00:15:19.090 --> 00:15:20.300
It's up to you!

00:15:24.440 --> 00:15:25.540
Maria!

00:15:27.150 --> 00:15:29.440
Thank you, Mom...

00:15:34.320 --> 00:15:37.050
No matter how many times you divide...

00:15:41.210 --> 00:15:42.320
No!

00:15:53.930 --> 00:15:56.040
I need to follow the one that escaped.

00:15:56.850 --> 00:16:00.310
That's the thing we brought 
down in Valverde...

00:16:08.780 --> 00:16:11.450
Even if the Symphogears are tough...

00:16:12.320 --> 00:16:15.540
...the hearts of their Wielders 
are easily broken.

00:16:15.980 --> 00:16:17.750
We'll throw everything we have at them.

00:16:22.150 --> 00:16:25.170
<i>Alca-Noise are advancing to sector 19!</i>

00:16:26.030 --> 00:16:28.510
That's where Lydian is!

00:16:28.810 --> 00:16:30.960
Stop spacing out and head there!

00:16:30.960 --> 00:16:31.960
Chris-chan!

00:16:31.960 --> 00:16:35.020
Senpai and I will take down 
the big one in the sky!

00:16:35.020 --> 00:16:37.230
B-But then...

00:16:37.230 --> 00:16:40.090
<i>There's a limit to what we can handle!</i>

00:16:45.060 --> 00:16:48.030
Believe in your justice and hold it tight!

00:16:48.030 --> 00:16:51.190
If nothing else, do what 
you believe to be best!

00:16:53.040 --> 00:16:55.360
<i>Thank you, Chris-chan!</i>

00:16:55.860 --> 00:16:57.750
<i>But I...</i>

00:16:57.750 --> 00:17:00.610
I've been waiting for this moment.

00:17:00.880 --> 00:17:02.340
Ignite Module!

00:17:02.340 --> 00:17:04.360
<i>You can save that craziness for later!</i>

00:17:07.620 --> 00:17:10.740
You're not the only one who's selfish!

00:17:17.300 --> 00:17:26.730
<i>Various Shul Shagana tron.</i>

00:18:00.980 --> 00:18:06.780
<i>Slashin' genocide, spiky spinning sounds</i>

00:18:06.780 --> 00:18:11.620
<i>You can cry but I won't stop</i>

00:18:07.730 --> 00:18:09.100
<b>α Style 100 Samsara</b>

00:18:12.570 --> 00:18:22.700
<i>Don't mess with me because I'm small, 
my saws are the most painful, understand?</i>

00:18:12.650 --> 00:18:14.610
<b>Kill Juliet</b>

00:18:18.470 --> 00:18:20.410
Shul Shagana and Igalima 
have engaged the enemy!

00:18:20.850 --> 00:18:25.170
We can't thank the guys 
at Iruma enough, can we?

00:18:23.370 --> 00:18:29.290
<i>For some reason my heart 
refuses to synchronize</i>

00:18:25.170 --> 00:18:26.780
Their vitals are stable.

00:18:26.780 --> 00:18:30.160
The backlash from the Symphogears
 is within expected limits.

00:18:29.290 --> 00:18:36.320
<i>but there's a melody of love 
that's just for the two of us</i>

00:18:30.420 --> 00:18:32.850
We got it done in time.

00:18:32.850 --> 00:18:35.110
Thank you, Elfnein-kun!

00:18:37.580 --> 00:18:45.970
<i>The moon can never shine on its own</i>

00:18:37.850 --> 00:18:40.480
What was needed to complete the 
LiNKER was to find the part

00:18:40.480 --> 00:18:44.010
of the brain that connects the
 Symphogear and the Wielder.

00:18:44.010 --> 00:18:45.970
That part of the brain which controls altruism,

00:18:45.970 --> 00:18:48.430
<i>The two of us are one</i>

00:18:46.640 --> 00:18:50.490
a willingness to protect someone,
 even if it means sacrificing oneself.

00:18:48.430 --> 00:18:55.070
<i>Let's bring our bonds together 
and let them overlap</i>

00:18:51.150 --> 00:18:53.390
In a word, it's...

00:18:53.720 --> 00:18:54.730
Love!

00:18:55.070 --> 00:19:02.900
<i>Let's support each other in 
overwhelming love and get better</i>

00:19:09.030 --> 00:19:11.850
I won't say this is the best.

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:16.550
Dr. Ver, you're the worst of the worst.

00:19:22.920 --> 00:19:28.810
<i>The shape of a heart cannot be analyzed</i>

00:19:28.810 --> 00:19:32.310
<i>It feels like I'll hurt anything I touch</i>

00:19:34.330 --> 00:19:44.240
<i>If it's a pain sharper than a knife, 
I don't want to give it to anyone.</i>

00:19:43.010 --> 00:19:45.190
In the end, you're helpless 
without your medicine.

00:19:45.190 --> 00:19:48.590
<i>I want us to understand each other</i>

00:19:45.620 --> 00:19:49.090
Don't think of the LiNKER as just medicine!

00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:52.210
It's the bonds between us 
that we all created together!

00:19:54.050 --> 00:19:58.000
<i>If I can have true power</i>

00:19:58.090 --> 00:19:59.420
<b>Δ Style Charming Axel Killer</b>

00:19:59.430 --> 00:20:08.050
<i>Let's run together, 
I'll use my whole soul as fuel</i>

00:20:08.050 --> 00:20:10.070
<i>So we can fight together</i>

00:20:10.570 --> 00:20:16.480
<i>Never losing our courage</i>

00:20:16.940 --> 00:20:21.560
<i>Let's overcome tomorrow and never let go</i>

00:20:16.950 --> 00:20:20.030
I know it'll bring us victory!

00:20:21.560 --> 00:20:27.200
<i>We have a dream!</i>

00:20:47.080 --> 00:20:48.680
Where are they?

00:20:51.840 --> 00:20:52.780
Kiri-chan!

00:20:52.780 --> 00:20:55.510
Your life will be fodder for the revolution!

00:21:00.150 --> 00:21:01.060
What?

00:21:01.400 --> 00:21:02.690
Hibiki-san.

00:21:02.690 --> 00:21:03.970
This is wrong...

00:21:04.480 --> 00:21:07.540
Using life as fodder is wrong!

00:21:07.540 --> 00:21:09.910
Just because it's three-on-three now...

00:21:09.910 --> 00:21:12.370
She's getting emotional.

00:21:18.940 --> 00:21:21.300
Wrong, it's six-on-three!

00:21:21.300 --> 00:21:23.200
Tsubasa-san! Chris-chan!

00:21:23.200 --> 00:21:24.290
Maria!

00:21:27.270 --> 00:21:30.990
It's time to talk, Bavarian Illuminati.

00:21:30.990 --> 00:21:32.140
What are you after?

00:21:32.140 --> 00:21:35.950
You said you were releasing 
humanity from all control.

00:21:35.950 --> 00:21:38.210
What are you fighting?

00:21:38.210 --> 00:21:41.450
Tell us what you want.

00:21:41.450 --> 00:21:46.000
If you're really fighting for someone 
else's sake, we can work together.

00:21:46.420 --> 00:21:48.020
Work together?

00:21:48.020 --> 00:21:49.280
The arrogance.

00:21:49.690 --> 00:21:54.460
We will use the power of the gods 
to break the curse of Balal.

00:21:56.090 --> 00:21:59.590
The power of the gods? The curse of Balal?

00:22:00.170 --> 00:22:02.660
We'll take control of the lunar ruins.
